{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fast-paced, action-packed shooter</strong> with a fluid user experience, engaging physics, and a variety of enemies and mechanics to avoid boring game-loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ZOMBIE RECALL</strong> is a work-in-progress developed by a small team that started two years ago. We believe the game is now ready to be tested and supported by true VR players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Early Access Beta</strong> is a two-hour experience that we released to gather community feedback on the content and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE ART:</strong> Located in a distopic future, with retro-futuristic vibes and techno-like music.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3089820?t=1743432845","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089820/afacf849f9c0e0234d0bfbbfc6b8098775d9e9f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743432845","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089820/be29173eeee41777d5367f9c70cb67d3e128b546/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743432845","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089820/be29173eeee41777d5367f9c70cb67d3e128b546/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743432845","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"\"The game features physical violence with weapons against humanoid 'mutants' and machines. It also includes toon-style gore with a body dismemberment system. The player can die in a 'combat training simulator' within the game.\""},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fast-paced, action-packed shooter</strong> with a fluid user experience, engaging physics, and a variety of enemies and mechanics to avoid boring game-loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ZOMBIE RECALL</strong> is a work-in-progress developed by a small team that started two years ago. We believe the game is now ready to be tested and supported by true VR players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Early Access Beta</strong> is a two-hour experience that we released to gather community feedback on the content and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE ART:</strong> Located in a distopic future, with retro-futuristic vibes and techno-like music.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["INSANUS"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089820/8ce47890a1165269ea19c17ca278e7a40dcb7ec4/header.jpg?t=1743432845","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116031,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116031/movie480.mp4?t=1743432842","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116031/movie_max.mp4?t=1743432842"},"name":"ZOMBIEW RECALL PREALPHA","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116031/951288354de1d266a27020f66d1a9d00876f8b20/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743432842","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116031/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743432842","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116031/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743432842"}}],"name":"ZOMBIE RECALL","package_groups":